{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night at the Mall game is a first-person psychological horror experience set during a single overnight shift in a sprawling shopping center. You are alone, surrounded by silence, flickering lights, and the unsettling feeling that something else might be here with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights work, but not always.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.poster.avif?t=1760806759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.webm?t=1760806759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.mp4?t=1760806759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cameras see, but not clearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.poster.avif?t=1760806759\" aria-label=\"Security Room\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.webm?t=1760806759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.mp4?t=1760806759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hours pass, but not quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\